        <mxCell id="OSfP_mvF0RlMdNvvo_aP-10" value="&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 15.0px; font: 21.0px &#39;.AppleSystemUIFont&#39;; color: #0e0e0e&quot;&gt;“If &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;firstname&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;lastname&lt;/span&gt; are both not null, can I infer a higher-level constraint like &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;are_both_not_null(firstname, lastname)&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;firstname != lastname&lt;/span&gt;?”&lt;/blockquote&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
